Aegisub: the licence of the file formats and behaviour HikariSub follows
========================================================================

HikariSub reads and writes Aegisub's [Aegisub Extradata] section and gives scripts line.extra and
the rest of the Lua API as Aegisub 3.5.1 does, after https://github.com/TypesettingTools/Aegisub,
with the Lua API additions of arch1t3cht's fork (https://github.com/arch1t3cht/Aegisub at
2cdf00436027383d0c7680e79890af13ef60f935, under the same licence). Its licence, from LICENCE
there at 33a4a056a42a9e9f27618a4c3d9bebba593f540e:

